% Experimental file-backed dense passive directory.
%
% Load this after compact_otter_candidate.in (or another configuration using
% passive_store=dense) and before the problem input:
%   bin/prover9 -f prover9.examples/compact_otter_candidate.in \
%     prover9.examples/compact_passive_file_directory_overlay.in problem.in
%
% The immutable passive bodies continue to use ancestor_store/passive_backing.
% This option moves the fixed 64-byte selector directory to a separate private
% temporary file.  The file is unlinked immediately and closes automatically
% at normal exit or after process termination.  Selector heaps remain in RAM.

assign(passive_directory,file).
